asset:        3d.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture (combined): the 3D cases: cameras, lights, 3D layers and their options
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work; generation: tools/aep/GENERATING.md, case map: docs/aep/CASES.md
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
